1
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:19,500
In 2007, Angelo Mastropietro was in the woods in Worcestershire, UK when it started to rain.

2
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:25,520
He looked for a place to keep dry and he discovered a cave house!

3
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,536
The cave house was 800 years old.

4
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:39,940
People lived in the rock-house for hundreds of years, but from about 1962, no one lived there and the house stayed empty.

5
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,188
Angelo liked the rock-house very much.

6
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:47,276
He looked into the possibility of buying it.

7
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:52,744
It was for sale and in 2010 he decided to get it.

8
00:00:53,580 --> 00:01:00,040
After that, he started to cut into the rock and to rebuild and modernise the house.

9
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:08,320
Angelo (who is English, even though his name is Italian) finished the house in nine months.

10
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:23,040
He was a businessman before he started the house, and before 2007 he was quite ill, so he wanted a place where it was possible for him to live in a happy and healthy way.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:32,080
He realised that he didn’t need to live in a huge apartment and that being closer to nature could help him feel better.

12
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:44,722
He worked for over a thousand hours from beginning to end, and he used £160,000 to buy the house and all the things that he needed.

13
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:54,509
He planned everything himself, he moved about 80 tons of rock himself and he painted the house.

14
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:59,339
Angelo tried to make a comfortable place to live.

15
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:08,280
The house has electricity, hot water and wi-fi, and there is heating under the floors of the rooms.

16
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:15,500
Angelo opened a deep hole 80 metres under the house to get natural water.

17
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:19,040
The house is not huge.

18
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:28,340
It is about 65 m2, with one bedroom, a living room, a kitchen and a bathroom with a shower.

19
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:39,460
Angelo doesn’t live there all the time, but he uses the house as a place to go to sometimes, to get away from his busy city life.

20
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:46,243
It’s also possible to rent the house and to stay there for a weekend or more.

21
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:56,280
This means that other people are able to enjoy Angelo’s happy house and maybe escape from their busy lives for a few days, too.
